msgstr "Du hast zu viel gelernt!"

#: characters/templates/characters/fragments/magic.html:50
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Your memorised spells use up more spell points than you have "
"available. Either forget some spells or\n"
"                take character templates that increase your spell points.\n"
"              "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Deine gelernten Zaubersprüche verbrauchen mehr Zauberpunkte als du zur "
"Verfügung hast. Entweder vergisst du einige Zaubersprüche oder\n"
"wählst neue Charakterschablonen, die deine Zauberpunkte erhöhen.\n"
"    "

#: characters/templates/characters/fragments/magic.html:56
msgid "Your current spell points are:"
msgstr "Deine aktuellen Zauberpunkte sind:"

#: characters/templates/characters/fragments/notes.html:19
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Notiz"

#: characters/templates/characters/fragments/pantheon.html:14
msgid ""
"\n"
"              Your attitude describes the basic orientation of your "
"character. The value ranges from 1 to 100, where 1\n"
"              stands for abysmally evil, 100 for exceptionally good-"
"natured.\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Deine Gesinnung beschreibt die Grundausrichtung deines Charakters. Der Wert "
"geht von 1 bis 100, wobei 1\n"
"für abgrundtief böse steht und 100 für außergewöhnlich gut.\n"
"   "

#: characters/templates/characters/fragments/pantheon.html:20
msgid "Your attitude is"
msgstr "Deine Gesinnung ist"

#: characters/templates/characters/fragments/pantheon.html:30
#: characters/templates/characters/includes/priest_action_cards.html:12
#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/grace.html:50
#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/priest_action.html:50
msgid "Grace"
msgstr "Gunst"

#: characters/templates/characters/fragments/pantheon.html:32
msgid ""
"\n"
"                Grace is a measure of your character's standing with their "
"deity. You can receive grace by doing things\n"
"                for your deity, or act on their behalf. Grace can be used to "
"perform divine acts.\n"
"              "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"      Gunst ist ein Maß für das Ansehen deines Charakters bei seiner "
"Gottheit. Du kannst Gunst erlangen, indem du\n"
"für deine Gottheit tust oder in ihrem Namen handelst. Gunst kann verwendet "
"werden, um göttliche Taten auszuführen.\n"
"      "

#: characters/templates/characters/fragments/pantheon.html:38
msgid "Your grace is"
