msgid "+Grace"
msgstr "+Gunst"

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/grace.html:23
msgid "Reduce Attitude"
msgstr "Gesinnung verringern"

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/grace.html:23
msgid "-Attitude"
msgstr "-Gesinnung"

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/grace.html:27
msgid "Increase Attitude"
msgstr "Gesinnung erhöhen"

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/grace.html:27
msgid "+Attitude"
msgstr "+Gesinnung"

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/grace.html:53
msgid ""
"You can receive grace by doing things for your deity, or act on their behalf."
msgstr ""
"Du kannst Gunst erhalten, wenn du Dinge für deine Gottheit tust, oder in "
"ihrem Sinne handelst."

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/grace.html:60
msgid ""
"Attitude describes the basic orientation of your character. The value ranges "
"from 1 to 100, where 1 stands for abysmally evil, 100 for exceptionally good-"
"natured."
msgstr ""
"Gesinnung beschreibt die grundlegende Ausrichtung deines Charakters. Der "
"Wert reicht von 1 bis 100, wobei 1 für abgrundtief böse, 100 für "
"außerordentlich gutmütig steht."

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/horror.html:18
#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/horror.html:21
msgid "Base Stress"
msgstr "Basisstress"

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/horror.html:26
msgid "Willpower + Logic"
msgstr "Willenskraft + Logik"

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/horror.html:27
msgid "Roll Stress Test"
msgstr "Stresstest würfeln"

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/horror.html:56
msgid ""
"\n"
"      Your base stress level is a measure of how much exposure you have had "
"to the horrors of the world.\n"
"      Your stress level cannot fall below your base stress level.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Dein Basisstress ist ein Maß dafür, wie sehr du den Schrecken der Welt "
"ausgesetzt warst.\n"
"Dein Stresslevel kann nicht unter deinen Basisstress fallen.\n"
"    "

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/horror.html:65
msgid ""
"\n"
"      Your current stress level. If it reaches your stress maximum,\n"
"      you will gain the condition <i>Consumed by dread</i>.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"   Dein aktueller Stresslevel. Wenn es dein Stressmaximum erreicht,\n"
"   erhälst du den Zustand <i>von Grauen erfasst</i>.\n"
"   "

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/horror.html:74
msgid ""
"\n"
"      This is the possible stress you can cope with.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    Dies ist der mögliche Stress, mit dem du umgehen kannst.\n"
"    "

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/horror.html:81
msgid "Your quirks"
msgstr "Deine Eigenarten"

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/horror.html:86
msgid ""
"\n"
"          You gained a not yet chosen quirk due to stress. Choose a\n"
"          Quirk from the list of available quirks or create a new one.\n"
"          Consult your Gamemaster to decide which quirk matches the\n"
"          situation.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Du hast eine Eigenart durch Stress bekommen, die du noch nicht gewählt "
"hast. \n"
"Wähle eine Eigenart aus der Liste der verfügbaren eigenarten oder erstelle "
"eine neue.\n"
"Sprich dich mit deinem Spielleiter ab, welche Eigenart am besten zur "
"Situation passt.\n"
"    "

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/horror.html:131
msgid "You don't have any quirks."
msgstr "Du hast keine Eigenarten."

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/item.html:105
msgid "Put into container"
msgstr "In Container legen"

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/magic.html:9
msgid "Use Arcana"
msgstr "Arkana benutzen"

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/magic.html:9
msgid "-Arcana"
msgstr "-Arkana"

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/magic.html:13
msgid "Restore Arcana"
msgstr "Arkana wiederherstellen"

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/magic.html:13
msgid "+Arcana"
msgstr "+Arkana"

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/magic.html:36
msgid "An arcana slot, which can be used to cast spells."
msgstr "Ein Arkana, das für Zauber benutzt werden kann."

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/magic.html:39
msgid "Used Arcana"
msgstr "Benutztes Arkana"

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/magic.html:42
msgid "A used arcane slot. This can be refreshed taking a rest."
msgstr "Ein benutztes Arkana. Dies kann durch eine Rast aufgefrischt werden."

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/note.html:23
msgid "Save Note"
msgstr "Notiz speichern"

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/note.html:27
msgid "Delete Note"
msgstr "Notiz Löschen"

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/protection.html:34
msgid "Restore all"
msgstr "Alle wiederherstellen"

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/protection.html:35
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Click on the shield icons above to spend protection points.\n"
"        You can spend protection points whenever a hit is taken and not "
"otherwise prevented.\n"
"      "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Klicke auf die Schildsymbole oben, um Schutzpunkte auszugeben.\n"
"Du kannst immer dann Schutzpunkte ausgeben, wenn du einen Treffer hinnehmen "
"musst und dieser nicht anderweitig verhindert werden kann.\n"
"    "

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/protection.html:45
#: phasesix/settings.py:320
msgid "Protection Types"
msgstr "Schutztypen"

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/protection.html:55
msgid ""
"\n"
"        This is an innate protection that comes from your character's "
"lineage. Unlike the other protection types, this\n"
"        protection does not deplete until the end of combat; it refreshes at "
"the start of the player's combat round.\n"
"      "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Dieser angeborene Schutz stammt aus der Abstammung des Charakters. Im "
"Gegensatz zu den anderen Schutzarten bleibt dieser nicht bis zum Ende des "
"Kampfes aufgebraucht, sondern wird zu Beginn jeder Kampfrunde des Spielers "
"erneuert.\n"
"   "

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/quirk.html:12
#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/spell.html:30
#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/template.html:11
msgid "Forget"
msgstr "Vergessen"

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/reputation.html:6
msgid ""
"\n"
"        Reputation represents the characters degree of popularity. "
"Reputation may be\n"
"        spent to get new character templates.\n"
"      "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Die Reputation gibt den Bekanntheitsgrad des Charakters an. Reputation kann\n"
"für den Erwerb neuer Charakterschablonen ausgegeben werden.\n"
"   "

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/reputation.html:12
msgid ""
"\n"
"        The game master distributes reputation after each game session and "
"for\n"
"        special events.\n"
"      "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Der Spielleiter verteilt die Reputation nach jeder Spielsitzung und bei\n"
"besonderen Ereignissen.\n"
"   "

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/reputation.html:58
msgid ""
"\n"
"            You have unspent reputation points. Use them to add new "
"templates to your\n"
"            character and advance in your professions.\n"
"          "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Du hast noch nicht ausgegebene Reputation. Nutze sie, um deinem\n"
"Charakter hinzuzufügen und in deinen Berufen aufzusteigen.\n"
"   "

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/riot_gear.html:13
#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/weapon.html:37
msgid "Repair"
msgstr "Reparieren"

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/riot_gear.html:43
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"        This shield provides %(t_cover)s cover. Roll a d6 for each hit, a "
"success prevents that hit.\n"
"      "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"     Dieses Schild bietet %(t_cover)s Deckung. Wirf für jeden Treffer einen "
"W6, jeder Erfolg verhindert den jeweiligen Treffer.\n"
"     "

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/riot_gear.html:53
msgid "Shield Cover"
msgstr "Schilddeckung"

#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/riot_gear.html:99
#: characters/templates/characters/sidebar/weapon.html:86
msgid "Condition"
msgstr "Zustand"

